{"id":"e0aa5fde480907b5","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-woodin-existence.md","title":"Woodin Witness Characterization","display":"thm-woodin-existence — Woodin Witness Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-woodin-existence","aliases":["58-thm-woodin-existence","Woodin Witness Characterization"],"display":"thm-woodin-existence — Woodin Witness Characterization","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-woodin-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-woodin-existence</span><span>Woodin Witness Characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-woodin-existence — Woodin Witness Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"164488c69fed4a7f\" href=\"?note=164488c69fed4a7f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md\">../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" href=\"?note=f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in V\">\\(\\delta\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V_\\delta\">\\(A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Woodin}\">\\(\\operatorname{Woodin}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"164488c69fed4a7f\" href=\"?note=164488c69fed4a7f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md\">../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa)\\)</span> is the direct metalinguistic witness predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" href=\"?note=f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}existence}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\operatorname{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\n\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}existence}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\operatorname{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\n\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the forward direction of the exact parameter-sensitive witness characterization registered upstream.</li>\n<li>Class targets and embeddings remain encapsulated in the direct metalinguistic witness predicate; the theorem does not invent an unavailable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassElemEmb}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassElemEmb}_S\\)</span> symbol or disguise class witnesses as ordinary set quantifiers.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kanamori, The Higher Infinite</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","lev